      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Really enjoyed working with Glow. They helped me to upgrade my existing Tesla Powerwall 2 system and add a second battery. It was easy to get a quote and book in a time for them to install the battery. Is was a pretty straightforward installl and they made some great recommendations on where to install the battery.I also asked them to help me by getting flexible exports so that I could export up to 10kw to the grid. This is because my second battery would allow me to export at the higher rate of 10kw and to take advantage of price spikes on Amber to better respond and make some extra cash.This was an annoying process but they persevered and eventually got the certificate and updated the settings on my inverter and battery. They needed to contact Fronius, my previous installer, and deal with SA power networks.",
