      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "One of our old (14 years) solar systems failed and needed prompt replacement ‘like-for-like’ to retain our FiT.  Received 3 quotes via SolarQuotes and all were great and very close on specs and prices.  Glow Heating and Cooling were able to accomodate our system specs for quality panels and inverter within the same competitive price range.  They were also able to complete the installation in our semi-rural location within the week.  The installers were punctual, polite, tidy and efficient, completing the job within a few hours, including removing the old system.  Our new system was up and running again the same day with confirmation from our power company for FiT compliance.  We are very happy to recommend Glow Heating and Cooling for all your solar needs - plus you’ll be supporting a local SA business!",
